rows.en:
{f:Wow|Oh}, {f:for a boy, you're|you're quite} a romantic, aren't you?
But you've got good taste.
Hee hee, actually I love cherry blossoms too.{p}

Hee hee hee.
That's the end of my story.
Well then, next person, go ahead...{p}

Hee hee hee, I wonder what I'd do~.
...Well, that's the end of my story.
On to the next person.{p}

Heh heh, don't come crying to me if you regret it later.
Well, for now, let me compose myself and go on with my story.
I'll tell you how I know this story...{p}

Heh heh.
What's the matter with you?
Are you scared already?{p}

Heh heh...
Just as I thought.
Then naturally, you always use the stairs.{p}

Heh heh...
You knew about the board all along, but you answered that you didn't, isn't that so?
...See, you did lie.{p}

...Heh heh heh.
He really was a forgetful one, wasn't he?
He had even forgotten where his own things were.{p}

Heh heh heh...
Don't worry.
I'll keep it a secret for you.{p}

Nanase...?
Or someone from much longer ago...?
Heh heh, maybe it wasn't only corpses that cart carried.{p}

Heh heh heh...
Of course not.
If you gave up on your homework here, everyone would laugh at you.{p}

Heh heh, to tell you the truth...
I...
I was sure you'd answer that way.{p}

Heh heh heh...
Don't worry.
I'll keep it a secret for you.{p}

Heh heh heh heh...
Still studying even after death... ghosts have it rough, don't they?
But a living person who wanders in there has it even rougher.{p}

Heh heh...
He was frozen stiff with fear, you see.
Though he insists he was just watching to see what would happen.{p}

Heh heh...
I thought so.
But I didn't tell anyone about it.{p}

Oh, is that what you're curious about?
Heh heh... Don't worry, I'll tell you.
But first, Nao's side of the story.{p}

Heh heh heh...
You know, you're rather popular.
People say there's a cute girl among the newspaper club's first-years...{p}

Heh heh heh...
My, {a}, your eyes have gone so wide...
...So you can't believe it after all?{p}
